Power BI Shortcuts (main one + Power Query )






Power Query UI:
First / Last column (selected entire column) - Home / End 
First / Last row (selected rows) - Alt + Home / End
Scroll page up / down (selected rows) - Page Up / Page Down
Select column - Ctrl + Space
Select all columns - Ctrl + A
Rename column - F2

Sort / Filter menu - Alt + Down Arrow
Data type menu - Ctrl + Arrow Down
Go to column - Ctrl + G






















